                                                "sense_id": "cd79e0dc-1465-3d72-8829-31842544bab8",
                                                "text": "One of the muscles on the point of the shoulder was torn loose and it didn't need more than a glance to see that Mr. Hickey was in for a long lay-off. He wouldn't pitch again for quite a spell, if ever;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93213a6b-e969-42c7-b7e0-e6eea7b29c8c",
                                                "sense_id": "cd79e0dc-1465-3d72-8829-31842544bab8",
                                                "text": "But even the return of skipper Steven Gerrard from a six-week injury layoff could not inspire Liverpool"
                                            },
